  entry: 
  dialogText: "Rune-Forged Fragment \u2192 +1 Arcana check for ancient magic\nAether-Fused
    Core \u2192 Restore 1d6 spell points or power a broken device\nWorld Thread Resonator\u2192
    Advantage on 1 magical saving throw per long rest\nEcho of the Forgotten \u2192
    Arcana DC 14: See a cryptic vision tied to Nyxholm\u2019s secret\n"
  exit: 
  backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
