  a: Open the Bag
  b: If No One Opens the Bag
  c: 
  d: 
  dialogText: 'The satchel carrying the Chronicle of Icarus shakes violently, as
    if reacting to something nearby. A faint hum pulses from within, sending arcane
    vibrations up your arm.

'
